sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant D  as Device (D)
    participant GW as Gateway (GW)

    Note over D,GW: Pre-stored at D  :  { K_GW-D ,  m_curr }<br/>Pre-stored at GW :  PID_curr → K_GW-D  and  PID_old → K_GW-D

    loop Every Sensing Interval

        Note over D: 1.  PID_curr  =  H( ID_D ∥ m_curr )   [rotating pseudonym — hides ID_D]<br/>2.  C  =  AES( K_GW-D ,  sensor_data )<br/>3.  Prepare packet:  PID_curr ∥ C

        D->>GW: ( PID_curr ,  AES( K_GW-D ,  sensor_data ) )

        Note over GW: 4.  Lookup session by PID_curr OR PID_old   [dual-state desync recovery]<br/>5.  sensor_data  =  AES_inv( K_GW-D ,  C )<br/>6.  Process and store sensor data

        GW-->>D: Acknowledgement

    end
